#: docs/skills.md:77
msgid "So yes, the skills exist — as structured definitions + typed schemas, with prose bodies shipped for the lifecycle and agent skills. The  MCP tool currently serves the  bodies; the authoring-skill prose bodies are the next thing to fill in (the definitions and contracts they'd attach to are already in place)."
